  {
    "chinese": "美之所以打动我们，是因为它唤起了内心深处对完美的渴望。",
    "english": "Beauty moves us precisely because it awakens in us a deep longing for perfection.",
    "soundmark": "/ˈbjuːti muːvz ʌs prɪˈsaɪsli bɪˈkɒz ɪt əˈweɪkənz ɪn ʌs ə diːp ˈlɒŋɪŋ fɔː pəˈfekʃn/",
